<title>USA: Hertz Corp in Class A stock buyback program.</title>
<headline>Hertz Corp in Class A stock buyback program.</headline>
<dateline>PARK RIDGE, N.J. 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hertz Corp said on Friday it has  instituted a program to repurchase from time to time up to 1.15 million  shares of its Class A Common Stock.</p>
<p>Hertz said this will be an ongoing program to meet obligations it  anticipates the company will incur during the next two years under  its incentive stock plan.</p>
<p>Hertz is a leading car rental company which was wholly owned by Ford  Motor Co prior to its inititial public offering in April with about  5,500 locations throughout the U.S. and in 140 other countries.</p>
</text>
